title:    week-14-private-service-connect
subtitle: What each directory is responsible for
width:    820
---
  terraform/          the VPC, the subnet with Private Google Access,
                      the PSC endpoint, and one probe VM with no external IP
  scripts/
    validate.sh       12 assertions, run against the live deployment
    break-pga.sh      deletes the default route, measures both paths,
                      and restores the route in a trap on every exit
  docs/
    FIGURE_PLAN.md    written before the deploy, in reader order
    deprecations.md   each service, the deprecation page read, and the date
    evidence/         raw command output behind every figure
    pga-vs-psc.json   the measurement itself
